<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Natbank allots 12.14 bln ats in quick repo.</title>
<headline>Austria Natbank allots 12.14 bln ats in quick repo.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allocated 12.14 billion schillings in quick securities repurchase agreements at a fixed 3.0 percent.</p>
<p>The central bank said 25 percent of bids were filled.</p>
<p>The tender runs from December 27-30. Earlier the central bank called for bids in one-week repos, also at three percent. -- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
